# Syntax: docs/LANGUAGE.md. Check with `rbb bid check`.
#
# Maximal doubles (`doubles.maximal`). We have bid and raised a major,
# 1M .. 2M, and they bid three of the suit directly below ours (3D under
# hearts, 3H under spades): there is no room left for a game try, so the
# double is the game try and three of our major is only competitive.
# Partner signs off in 3M with a minimum or bids game with a maximum.
# (Bridge Bum, "Maximal Double"; Todd, "Non-Takeout Doubles", Advancing
# in Bridge 357.) Alertable.
#
# Applies to the opener after 1M (any) 2M and to the overcaller after
# (1x) 1M (any) 2M. Against any other three-level bid (not the suit just
# below ours) the double stays what it was.

module maximal-doubles "Maximal doubles"
  card   doubles.maximal
  needs  base
  needs  overcalls
  skill  competitive_bidding/maximal_doubles

# ── The opener or the overcaller ─────────────────────────────────────
# The game try is the opener's usual invitation over a single raise,
# 17-18 support points (rebids.bid); 3M competes with six trumps (five and
# a shape) and no game interest.
after 1M (*) 2M (3x) | (1y) 1M (*) 2M (3x) when (M is H, x is D) | (M is S, x is H)
  X   "Maximal double: a game try in {M}"
      alert  artificial
      shows  tp(M)=17..18
      sets   trump=M, ask=maximal(M)
      priority 2
  3{M} "Competitive: no game interest"
      shows M>=6 | (M>=5, !balanced), tp(M)<=16
      sets  trump=M
      priority 1
  4{M} "Game: 19+ with the fit"
      shows tp(M)>=19
      sets  trump=M
      priority 1
  P   "Nothing more to say"  priority -5

# ── Partner answers the game try ─────────────────────────────────────
# The raise was 6-10: the top of it (9+ support points) accepts.
when asked maximal(t)
  4{t} "Accepts the game try: a maximum raise"
      shows tp(t)>=9
      priority 1
  3{t} "Declines: a minimum raise"
      priority 1

# ── Partner after the competitive 3M ─────────────────────────────────
after 1M (*) 2M (3x) 3M (P) | (1y) 1M (*) 2M (3x) 3M (P) when (M is H, x is D) | (M is S, x is H)
  P   "Partner's 3{M} was only competitive"  priority 1
